concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-11-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11(8) Advisory Councils and committees"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-11-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) In addition to Advisory Councils, the Board may establish advisory committees, consisting of such persons as the Board appoints, to furnish advice to the Board on particular matters or classes of matters relating to the functions of the Corporation." ;
    skos:definition "(8) In addition to Advisory Councils, the Board may establish advisory committees, consisting of such persons as the Board appoints, to furnish advice to the Board on particular matters or classes of matters relating to the functions of the Corporation."@en ;
