concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-18-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "18 Removal from office of non-executive Directors"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-18-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Governor-General may remove a non-executive Director from office for misbehaviour or physical or mental incapacity. (2) If: (a) a non-executive Director becomes bankrupt, takes steps to take the benefit of any law for the relief of bankrupt or insolvent debtors, compounds with one or more of his or her creditors or makes an assignment of his or her remuneration for the benefit of one or more of his or her creditors; or (aa) the staff-elected Director ceases to be eligible to hold office as the staff-elected Director; or (b) the Chairperson, or a Director acting as Chairperson, is absent, except with the leave of the Minister, from 3 consecutive meetings of the Board; or" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Governor-General may remove a non-executive Director from office for misbehaviour or physical or mental incapacity. (2) If: (a) a non-executive Director becomes bankrupt, takes steps to take the benefit of any law for the relief of bankrupt or insolvent debtors, compounds with one or more of his or her creditors or makes an assignment of his or her remuneration for the benefit of one or more of his or her creditors; or (aa) the staff-elected Director ceases to be eligible to hold office as the staff-elected Director; or (b) the Chairperson, or a Director acting as Chairperson, is absent, except with the leave of the Minister, from 3 consecutive meetings of the Board; or"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "dafafab677dcb1550b894943e40e284b29c43cdfb0f52775de67bf1b53074593" ;
    cof:pageNumber "25"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-18-2-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-18-2-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.25" .
