concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-22-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22(8) Meetings of the Board"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-22-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) The Managing Director shall not be present during any deliberation, or take part in any decision, of the Board with respect to the appointment, or any of the terms and conditions of employment, of the Managing Director." ;
    skos:definition "(8) The Managing Director shall not be present during any deliberation, or take part in any decision, of the Board with respect to the appointment, or any of the terms and conditions of employment, of the Managing Director."@en ;
