concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-23-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23 Delegation by Corporation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-23-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Corporation may, either generally or as otherwise provided by the instrument of delegation, by writing under its seal, delegate to a Director or to an employee of the Corporation all or any of its powers under this Act, the regulations or the rules, other than this power of delegation. (2) A power so delegated, when exercised by the delegate, shall, for the purposes of this Act, the regulations or the rules, be deemed to have been exercised by the Corporation. (3) A delegation of a power under this section does not prevent the exercise of the power by the Corporation. (4) A reference in this section to a Director shall, if a person is acting as a Director, be construed as including a reference to a person so acting." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Corporation may, either generally or as otherwise provided by the instrument of delegation, by writing under its seal, delegate to a Director or to an employee of the Corporation all or any of its powers under this Act, the regulations or the rules, other than this power of delegation. (2) A power so delegated, when exercised by the delegate, shall, for the purposes of this Act, the regulations or the rules, be deemed to have been exercised by the Corporation. (3) A delegation of a power under this section does not prevent the exercise of the power by the Corporation. (4) A reference in this section to a Director shall, if a person is acting as a Director, be construed as including a reference to a person so acting."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9cbc71ff6d1b03b272000705130aa4452b1e9a4be331f3da03f1dd8f5722da30" ;
    cof:pageNumber "30"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-23-2-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-23-2-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-23-2-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-23-2-ss-4 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983.pdf, p.30" .
