concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-24b-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24B(4) Functions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-24b-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Nomination Panel may conduct one selection process for 2 or more of the following appointments (including any combination of them): (a) an appointment of the Chairperson; (b) an appointment of a Director referred to in paragraph 12(1)(c); (c) an appointment of the Chairperson under the Special Broadcasting Service Act 1991;" ;
    skos:definition "(4) The Nomination Panel may conduct one selection process for 2 or more of the following appointments (including any combination of them): (a) an appointment of the Chairperson; (b) an appointment of a Director referred to in paragraph 12(1)(c); (c) an appointment of the Chairperson under the Special Broadcasting Service Act 1991;"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "77e3fcb73ab5893aa86840baf5e2a98101424659c973a57eb143f33abe29a629" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-24b ;
