    values:originalText "(4) The Nomination Panel may conduct one selection process for 2 or more of the following appointments (including any combination of them): (a) an appointment of the Chairperson; (b) an appointment of a Director referred to in paragraph 12(1)(c); (c) an appointment of the Chairperson under the Special Broadcasting Service Act 1991;" ;
