    skos:prefLabel "24Q Holding of meetings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-24q ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Nomination Panel is to hold such meetings as are necessary for the performance of its functions. (2) The Chair may convene a meeting at any time." ;
