concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-24u a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24U Conduct of meetings"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-24u ;
    values:originalText "The Nomination Panel may, subject to this Division, regulate proceedings at its meetings as it considers appropriate. Note: Section 33B of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 provides for participation in meetings by telephone etc.   Merit-based appointment of non-executive Directors  Part IIIA Meetings of Nomination Panel  Division 3 Section 24V Australian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983 Compilation date: 18/02/2022 Registered: 23/02/2022" ;
    skos:definition "The Nomination Panel may, subject to this Division, regulate proceedings at its meetings as it considers appropriate. Note: Section 33B of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 provides for participation in meetings by telephone etc.   Merit-based appointment of non-executive Directors  Part IIIA Meetings of Nomination Panel  Division 3 Section 24V Australian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983 Compilation date: 18/02/2022 Registered: 23/02/2022"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0314a7449caa4bc0748e4ba667fe997a01cd8a373105ab061ac72df340823e47" ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Regulate proceedings at meetings as considered appropriate." ;
