concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-24w a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24W Selection criteria"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-24w ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must, by legislative instrument, determine selection criteria for the appointment of a Director referred to in paragraph 12(1)(b) or (c). (2) The Minister may, in relation to a particular such appointment, give a written notice to the Nomination Panel of additional selection criteria for that appointment. (3) A notice under subsection (2) is not a legislative instrument." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister must, by legislative instrument, determine selection criteria for the appointment of a Director referred to in paragraph 12(1)(b) or (c). (2) The Minister may, in relation to a particular such appointment, give a written notice to the Nomination Panel of additional selection criteria for that appointment. (3) A notice under subsection (2) is not a legislative instrument."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5d217408b30fc7d3a6ea641eccfabe3e593fe35ce568a5e0fe087bed6d16c8c5" ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-24w-ss-1 ;
