concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-26 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26 Corporation to have regard to services of the Special"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26 ;
    values:originalText "Broadcasting Service Corporation In performing its functions, the Corporation must have regard to the services provided by the Special Broadcasting Service Corporation.   Powers and duties of the Corporation  Part IV  Section 27 Australian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983 Compilation date: 18/02/2022 Registered: 23/02/2022" ;
    skos:definition "Broadcasting Service Corporation In performing its functions, the Corporation must have regard to the services provided by the Special Broadcasting Service Corporation.   Powers and duties of the Corporation  Part IV  Section 27 Australian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983 Compilation date: 18/02/2022 Registered: 23/02/2022"@en ;
