concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-31aa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "31AA Corporation or prescribed companies to be the only providers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-31aa ;
    values:originalText "of Commonwealth-funded international broadcasting services The Commonwealth must not enter into a contract or other arrangement with a person or body other than: (a) the Corporation; or (b) a prescribed company (within the meaning of section 25A); if the contract or arrangement: (c) is for the provision of international broadcasting services; and (d) provides for the Commonwealth to make payments to the person or body." ;
    skos:definition "of Commonwealth-funded international broadcasting services The Commonwealth must not enter into a contract or other arrangement with a person or body other than: (a) the Corporation; or (b) a prescribed company (within the meaning of section 25A); if the contract or arrangement: (c) is for the provision of international broadcasting services; and (d) provides for the Commonwealth to make payments to the person or body."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "245909253f25e2c6b9b2f8dc6a21305ff5e0b12997e805e90bb562dfa2964601" ;
    cof:pageNumber "53"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Only Commonwealth-funded international broadcasting services can be provided by the Corporation or prescribed companies." ;
    dc:description "true" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
