doc:sec-70b-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "70B(7) Borrowings otherwise than from Commonwealth" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) For the purposes of this section, if: (a) the Corporation issues an instrument that acknowledges a debt; (b) the instrument is issued in consideration of the payment or deposit of money; and (c) the instrument is issued in relation to a transaction that is not a routine operational transaction; the Corporation shall be taken to raise money otherwise than by borrowing and the amount of money raised shall be taken to be the amount of the money paid or deposited.   Finance  Part VI  Section 70C Australian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983 Compilation date: 18/02/2022 Registered: 23/02/2022" ;
    cof:pageNumber "58"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "70B(8) Borrowings otherwise than from Commonwealth"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-70b-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) For the purposes of this section, if: (a) the Corporation issues an instrument that acknowledges a debt; (b) the instrument is issued in consideration of the provision of credit; and (c) the instrument is issued in relation to a transaction that is not a routine operational transaction; the Corporation shall be taken to raise money otherwise than by borrowing and the amount of money raised shall be taken to be the amount of the value of the credit provided." ;
    skos:definition "(8) For the purposes of this section, if: (a) the Corporation issues an instrument that acknowledges a debt; (b) the instrument is issued in consideration of the provision of credit; and (c) the instrument is issued in relation to a transaction that is not a routine operational transaction; the Corporation shall be taken to raise money otherwise than by borrowing and the amount of money raised shall be taken to be the amount of the value of the credit provided."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4a30c09e63346751cee123822bb1c5901961d1306ab1bb2e9a4f2b46178c4e05" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b ;
    cof:pageNumber "58"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Corporation must raise money from a non-borrowing source when issuing an instrument acknowledging a debt in consideration of credit provided." ;
