concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-70b-ss-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "70B(9) Borrowings otherwise than from Commonwealth"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-70b-ss-9 ;
    values:originalText "(9) For the purposes of this section, if: (a) the Corporation obtains credit; and (b) the credit is obtained in relation to a transaction that is not a routine operational transaction; the Corporation shall be taken to raise money otherwise than by borrowing and the amount of money raised shall be taken to be the amount of the value of the credit obtained." ;
    skos:definition "(9) For the purposes of this section, if: (a) the Corporation obtains credit; and (b) the credit is obtained in relation to a transaction that is not a routine operational transaction; the Corporation shall be taken to raise money otherwise than by borrowing and the amount of money raised shall be taken to be the amount of the value of the credit obtained."@en ;
