concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-78-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "78(5) Power of Minister to give directions to Corporation in the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-78-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Where the Minister gives a direction to the Corporation under this section, the Minister shall cause a statement setting out particulars of, and the reasons for, the direction to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 7 sitting days of that House after the direction was given.   Miscellaneous  Part VIII  Section 79 Australian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983 Compilation date: 18/02/2022 Registered: 23/02/2022" ;
    skos:definition "(5) Where the Minister gives a direction to the Corporation under this section, the Minister shall cause a statement setting out particulars of, and the reasons for, the direction to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 7 sitting days of that House after the direction was given.   Miscellaneous  Part VIII  Section 79 Australian Broadcasting Corporation Act 1983 Compilation date: 18/02/2022 Registered: 23/02/2022"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "93750619f67aca63c104e45068c77596a5ed507fbecf24a77bee957412dbf82c" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-78 ;
