concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-78-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "78(6) Power of Minister to give directions to Corporation in the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-78-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Except as provided by this section, or as expressly provided by a provision of another Act, the Corporation is not subject to direction by or on behalf of the Government of the Commonwealth." ;
