concept:australian-broadcasting-corporation-act-1983-sec-79a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "79A Broadcasting of political or controversial matter"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-79a ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to this Act, the Corporation may determine to what extent and in what manner political matter or controversial matter will be broadcast by the Corporation." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subject to this Act, the Corporation may determine to what extent and in what manner political matter or controversial matter will be broadcast by the Corporation."@en ;
